# oracle: examples/balance in.balance.kspace shortened (fcc 6x6x6 cells instead of 10x10x10, run 20 steps instead of 500, one processor): pair lj/long/coul/long long off 2.5 with pppm/disp 1e-4 and kspace_modify gewald/disp 0.1 (the default pair_modify table/disp 12: the dispersion table), fix balance with weights; per-atom compare
# engine vs native fixture: thermo max relative error 3.4e-15, per-atom max relative error 2.8e-12 (target 1e-8); engine time 0.83 s
# native: installed lmp (b332f28)
units           lj
processors      * 1 1
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box block 0 6 0 6 0 6
create_box      3 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            * 1.0
region          long block 3 6 0 6 0 6
set             region long type 2
velocity        all create 1.0 87287
pair_style      lj/long/coul/long long off 2.5
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 1.0 2.5
pair_coeff      * 2 1.0 1.0 5.0
kspace_style    pppm/disp 1.0e-4
kspace_modify   gewald/disp 0.1
neighbor        0.3 bin
neigh_modify    every 2 delay 4 check yes
group           fast type 1
group           slow type 2
fix             0 all balance 20 1.0 shift x 5 1.0 weight group 2 fast 1.0 slow 2.0 weight time 0.66
fix             1 all nve
thermo          10
thermo_style    custom step temp pe evdwl elong ecoul press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             20
